            "paragraph": "My curiosity was further piqued as we entered into the Benguela Current off Cape Town. There we quickly entered into a pool of relatively buoyant water contained within a strong anticyclonic eddy. The common wisdom at the time was that the Benguela Current was drawn from the cooler water flowing eastward within the poleward limb of the South Atlantic's subtropical gyre.",
