            "paragraph": "The temperature/salinity stratification and thermocline depth clearly responds to ENSO (Bray et al., 1996; Sprintall et al., 2003). In a sense, the stratification seasonality is echoed in ENSO: the January to March northwest monsoon is El Ni\u00f1o-like and the July to September southeast monsoon is La Ni\u00f1a-like.",
